        <item>
            <title>Version 2.6.2</title>
            <sparkle:version>2.6.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.6.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.0.17763</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 07:40:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Remio Client 2.6.2</h2>
                <h3>Fixed</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Crash when returning to a window whose session had ended.</li>
                    <li>Session could become input-dead when the relay notice appeared.</li>
                    <li>Closed streaming window kept running invisibly and burning CPU.</li>
                    <li>Per-session graphics memory leak.</li>
                    <li>Copying very large clipboard content killed clipboard sync for the session.</li>
                    <li>Device list pegging a CPU core.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Internal</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Windows App SDK 1.6 &rarr; 1.7, reproducible packaging, pairing telemetry.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
